cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Bank Regulatory Data Dictionary"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Anderson
    given-names: Nicholas
    website: "https://www.nickanderson.us/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/andenick/bank-data-dictionary"
abstract: >-
  An open catalogue of U.S. bank regulatory data: the major information
  collections and their subschedules, the MDRM code system, the FFIEC NIC
  institutional-structure data, the identifier crosswalk, cross-form mappings
  and reconciliation formulas, published as CSV and JSON alongside a written
  guide to each form.
keywords:
  - banking
  - regulatory-data
  - mdrm
  - ffiec
  - call-report
  - fr-y-9c
version: "10.0"
date-released: "2026-06-11"
license: MIT
